ROUTE bearTreeClip.fraction_changed TO bearTreeClip_rot0.set_fraction
ROUTE bearTreeClip_rot0.value_changed TO dad_cliptron.set_rotation
ROUTE bearTreeClip.fraction_changed TO bearTreeClip_scl1.set_fraction
ROUTE bearTreeClip_scl1.value_changed TO dad_bearTreeBall.set_scale
